1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
你以为蛋挞，是西式甜点？
You think egg tarts are Western?

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
广州酒楼，1927年就在卖
Guangzhou teahouses sold them in 1927

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
广东师傅，把英式蛋挞改了本地
Cantonese chefs made it their own

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
用猪油代黄油，更酥更香
Lard for butter — flakier, richer

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
后来传到香港，成了"港式"
It reached Hong Kong — "HK style"

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
港式：光滑嫩黄的蛋面
HK: a smooth, golden custard top

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
葡式：焦糖斑点，1989年澳门
Portuguese: burnt spots, Macau 1989

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
一口酥皮，一口滑蛋
Crisp shell, then silky egg

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
早茶"四大天王"，收官
Dim sum's Four Kings — the finale

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
虾饺·烧卖·叉烧包·蛋挞
Har gow, siu mai, bao, egg tart

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,200
四样叹齐，才算喝过早茶
All four? Then you've truly done yum cha

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,600
港式还是葡式，你站哪个？
HK or Portuguese — which side are you?
